  "informal_statement": "**IMO 2009 Problem 1.**\n\nZero-based formulation.\n\n`a 0, ..., a (k-1)` are distinct integers in `{1, ..., n}` and\n\n    n ∣ a i * (a (i+1) - 1)\n\nfor every consecutive pair.\n\nThen\n\n    n ∤ a (k-1) * (a 0 - 1).",
